From b88512985a59cffe69211283787870a1d6ad9fce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slydlake <sly.dlake@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:50:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] data/recipes: q38-27b MXFP4 containers (trunk, DFlash2
 drafter variants, E4M3 embedding and codebooks)

Recipes for rad-convert of a Qwen3.8-27B OCP-MXFP4 release (compressed-tensors
mxfp4-pack-quantized, e.g. llm-compressor GPTQ) with the z-lab
Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2 drafter merged in. The MXFP4 trunk is copied (no rule
names it); the rules cover what the release left bf16.

- q38-27b-mxfp4: trunk only; lm_head and the MTP block block-fp8, the delta
  net's a/b projection widened exactly to bf16.
- -df2: + DFlash2 drafter at block fp8 with a 2-bit head copy.
- -df2mx / -df2mxf: drafter linears MXFP4 (all, or feed-forward and fc only);
  RTN to MXFP4 costs acceptance on code.
- -df2h4 / -df2h8: 4-bit (u4) / int8 draft head; u4 is the recommendation.
- -df2h4l4 / -df2h4l4a: + int4 target lm_head (i4 sym g128, then u4 asym g64).
- -df2h4l4am: + the drafter's linears MXFP4 under the op scratch fix.
- -df2h4l4ame: + the token embedding as E4M3 under one f32 scale.
- -df2h4l4ames (recommended): + the drafter's selector codebooks as E4M3 with
  an f32 scale a row, 16.50 GiB (rad-convert --plan-only: 84 quantised
  weights).

Measurements per step are in the commits that introduced each row.

Sources are named, not local: trunk akumaburn/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-heretic
quantised with llm-compressor GPTQ (MXFP4A16, static actorder, lm_head/visual/mtp
ignored, 89 samples, sequence length 2048), drafter incoai/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2.

The recommended recipe's finished container is published as
slybase/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-heretic-MXFP4-DFlash2-radiance on Hugging Face
(private for now); "radiance" is in the name because the .rad format only runs
with Radiance. Recipe headers carry the HF names of the sources instead of local
checkpoint paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
